WEBVTT

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:22.080
Looking up at the purple panorama of the galaxy highway...

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:30.190
...a shooting star pierces my heart.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:38.000
synchronized with the sleepless city...
My accelerating heartbeat is

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:44.770
...and I suddenly pray for the unseen tomorrow...

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:50.010
...that brings that melody.

00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:56.950
A mysterious voice won't let me go.

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:03.560
Oh, tell me seventh moon, this frustrated heart...

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:09.330
...where will you take me to?

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:15.840
To sway in the blue seventh moon...

00:01:16.270 --> 00:01:25.750
...searching for the answer to the rhythm in this crazy dance.

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:35.300
Hey, what did
Ray do before ?

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:38.000
He was a pilot...
an elite forces pilot.

00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:43.000
That won't be necessary !
Just give us a bit more time !

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:47.260
Compared to how good I used to be,
he's still got a ways to go.

00:01:47.260 --> 00:01:51.650
This is Ray Lovelock. How's the
maintenance on the VF-19 going ?

00:01:51.650 --> 00:01:54.200
I was Stephan's girlfriend.

00:01:56.490 --> 00:01:58.100
Why do you always
pull stunts like this ?

00:01:58.100 --> 00:01:59.790
I told you I'd
go and get it !

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:19.930
I got the lead role !
The lead role !

00:02:21.330 --> 00:02:24.080
To get the lead role for the debut
TV broadcast all of a sudden...

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:26.250
...it's like a dream !

00:02:28.130 --> 00:02:30.610
The Linn Minmei Story
TV Special.

00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:34.690
Oh, hush.

00:02:34.930 --> 00:02:37.610
Come on,
I'm Linn Minmei.

00:02:38.690 --> 00:02:40.000
Good for you.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:42.920
What's with your attitude ? Is it so
wrong for you to be happy for me ?

00:02:42.920 --> 00:02:44.600
Whether or not
I'm happy is up to me.

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:48.060
What's wrong with you ?
This is Fire Bomber's first big break !

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:51.580
And you're taking this disinterested
attitude from the start !

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:54.380
Be quiet.
That's not what I said.

00:02:54.380 --> 00:02:57.090
Then why don't you be sincere
about it and be happy ?

00:02:57.090 --> 00:02:59.500
Our songs are going
to be playing on TV.

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:01.300
Right ?

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:02.300
Uh, right.

00:03:02.650 --> 00:03:03.550
See ?

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:06.790
I already knew that.

00:03:16.100 --> 00:03:22.030
Minmei Video

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:26.500
I get it, Basara !

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:28.410
What is it ?

00:03:31.260 --> 00:03:32.410
What is it now ?

00:03:34.050 --> 00:03:34.760
Man...

00:03:34.760 --> 00:03:36.170
You're embarrassed...

00:03:37.170 --> 00:03:40.700
To play the role of Ichijo Hikaru,
you have to be sensitive.

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:43.610
The total opposite of you...

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:46.350
You're afraid you won't
be able to do it.

00:03:46.350 --> 00:03:47.550
What are you
talking about ?

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:50.050
I knew it !

00:03:50.050 --> 00:03:52.390
Sure enough,
you're all anxious.

00:03:54.180 --> 00:03:56.570
You must have a
fever or something.

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:58.470
Watch your step
at the end.

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:43.510
All the same, you want
to do this, right ?

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:45.800
Ichijo Hikaru.

00:04:46.600 --> 00:04:48.600
I never said
I wanted to do this.

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:53.860
But usually, you're even more disinterested,
and you'd say, "I won't do it," or "stop it."

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:57.450
You really want
to do it, right...

00:04:57.450 --> 00:04:58.450
...Hikaru ?

00:04:59.460 --> 00:05:01.760
Dammit, I can't
take you anywhere.

00:05:01.990 --> 00:05:05.200
What's that supposed to mean ?
Are you implying something ?! What is it ?!

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:06.750
A child like you
wouldn't understand.

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:07.700
What ?!

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:10.870
You're even more of a child...
always talking without thinking !

00:05:12.050 --> 00:05:13.260
Be careful, now.

00:05:19.760 --> 00:05:25.430
I have been selected to play the role of the
Zentraedi warrior Breetai. I'm Suren Langu.

00:05:25.430 --> 00:05:29.200
I've been chosen to play Kamujin.
I'm Rolei Shuman.

00:05:29.660 --> 00:05:33.100
I'm the leader of Fire Bomber,
Ray Lovelock. Nice to meet you.

00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:35.450
Nice to meet
you as well.

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:45.200
I have been selected to play the role of the
Zentraedi warrior Breetai. I'm Suren Langu.

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:47.850
I've been chosen
to play Kamujin...

00:05:47.850 --> 00:05:51.330
Man, was I scared. I wonder if
my mom used to be that big, too.

00:05:53.300 --> 00:05:56.550
That's right...
She is a Meltrandi.

00:05:57.050 --> 00:06:00.800
That must mean, you have the blood
of giants running through your veins.

00:06:04.750 --> 00:06:11.350
To the staff participating in the
Linn Minmei Story, good work.

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:13.450
I'm the producer, Jakal Chan.

00:06:14.150 --> 00:06:18.340
Please let me explain to you
my vision for this video.

00:06:18.340 --> 00:06:22.140
But before that, let me
introduce our special guests.

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:24.110
Mayor Miria.

00:06:28.190 --> 00:06:29.750
Good morning, everyone.

00:06:31.850 --> 00:06:33.600
Mom, what are
you doing here ?

00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:36.750
I'm going to be working on this too.
You didn't know that ?

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:39.950
...Miria was known as an
ace among the Meltrandi.

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:48.100
Her dog-fighting genius met its match
in Macross 7's Captain, Maximilian Jenius.

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:54.150
The main feature of this video is the
historical idol singer, Linn Minmei.

00:06:54.550 --> 00:06:59.450
With her song, she was
able to win the war...

00:06:59.450 --> 00:07:05.890
...and end the fighting between the forces
of Earth and the Zentraedi soldiers.

00:07:05.890 --> 00:07:11.150
We also would like to add, as a sub-story, the tale of Maximilian Jenius and Miria Farina...

00:07:11.150 --> 00:07:13.960
...as a documentary.

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:22.350
So Dad's going to be
working on this video, too ?

00:07:22.350 --> 00:07:25.450
That's the way
it worked out.

00:07:25.450 --> 00:07:26.650
Dad ?

00:07:27.240 --> 00:07:31.240
Our other special guest,
Captain Maximilian, has arrived.

00:07:32.510 --> 00:07:33.860
Everyone, thank you.

00:07:37.740 --> 00:07:39.050
Basara !

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:42.750
This is a recruitment video for the
Unified Forces and the City Offices.

00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:47.650
Well, the only accurate parts
are about Mom and Dad.

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:49.560
I'm going to withdraw.

00:07:49.560 --> 00:07:52.150
Why ?
We're the leads !

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:53.600
That's not the point.

00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:54.950
Then what is the point ?

00:07:56.150 --> 00:07:57.700
You wouldn't understand.

00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:00.900
Why not ? Are you going to say that
a child like me wouldn't understand again ?

00:08:00.900 --> 00:08:02.200
Wait a sec.

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:07.810
Regardless of the whole lead role thing,
this is still a big opportunity for Fire Bomber.

00:08:07.810 --> 00:08:12.170
We'll be able to let
everyone hear how we sound.

00:08:12.440 --> 00:08:13.900
Ray...

00:08:13.900 --> 00:08:15.750
You knew about this
from the start, right ?

00:08:16.750 --> 00:08:17.760
No.

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:22.000
Well, it doesn't matter.
I don't want anything to do with this.

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:23.720
Basara, are you
really quitting ?!

00:08:26.350 --> 00:08:27.350
Basara !

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:34.210
It's hard playing the
part of a circus geek.

00:08:35.010 --> 00:08:38.360
Here's an itemized list of
complaints the City Office drew up.

00:08:39.890 --> 00:08:44.660
The residents of Macross 7 fear for
their lives when they walk the streets.

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:52.200
We can't capture even one of the abductors.
We don't have a cure for the victims.

00:08:52.200 --> 00:08:53.530
What the hell is
the military doing ?

00:08:54.150 --> 00:08:56.200
Don't blame me.

00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:58.650
We haven't confirmed
anything yet.

00:08:58.650 --> 00:09:00.450
We only know that
the enemy's machines...

00:09:00.450 --> 00:09:06.350
...seem to be of the type sent to the
4th planet in the Varauta 3198XE System.

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:08.050
That's all you know ?

00:09:08.050 --> 00:09:11.820
Do you even know the reasons
why I agreed to do this video ?

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:14.850
I do know. They're the
same reasons I'm doing it.

00:09:15.350 --> 00:09:17.000
It's a complicated
balancing act.

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:23.250
To satisfy the Military and the City Office's
agenda, using our legendary story...

00:09:23.770 --> 00:09:26.450
I opposed it, too.

00:09:26.950 --> 00:09:30.150
They'll still have complaints for
the Military and the City Office.

00:09:30.150 --> 00:09:32.440
Macross 7's citizens
aren't stupid.

00:09:32.440 --> 00:09:34.820
That's true.
Miria...

00:09:35.790 --> 00:09:37.800
...I have a bad
feeling about this.

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:39.600
As if something unexpected
is going to happen.

00:09:53.750 --> 00:10:01.250
This is surprising. These people have
the ability to increase their Spiritia level.

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:06.580
The time to carry out the Spiritia
Farm Project is approaching.

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:21.800
The Unified Forces were involved in a
desperate fight with the Zentraedi forces.

00:10:21.800 --> 00:10:23.900
In particular,
with an ace named Miria.

00:10:23.900 --> 00:10:26.550
Hey, that's you, Mom.
Was that when you were a giant ?

00:10:26.550 --> 00:10:27.750
Uh...yes.

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:30.770
Say, why did you
become a micron ?

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:32.560
Were you totally
gaga over Dad ?

00:10:32.560 --> 00:10:34.110
I wonder myself.

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:36.270
But you haven't
changed one bit.

00:10:36.270 --> 00:10:37.400
"Haven't changed ?"

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:39.150
You haven't aged any.

00:10:39.150 --> 00:10:40.080
Thank you.

00:10:40.080 --> 00:10:42.550
You dropped seven kids...

00:10:42.550 --> 00:10:44.330
...you must be a monster.

00:10:45.900 --> 00:10:48.650
Why would Dad break up
with a beauty like you ?

00:10:48.650 --> 00:10:51.620
Mylene !
We haven't broken up.

00:10:51.720 --> 00:10:54.310
What ?
But I was there when...

00:10:54.310 --> 00:10:55.960
Listen here.

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:58.780
Both your father and I are
very busy with a lot of things.

00:10:58.780 --> 00:11:01.550
So it's still a secret from
everyone else. Understood ?

00:11:02.270 --> 00:11:04.100
I get it, I get it.

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:05.670
I get it already !

00:11:06.030 --> 00:11:06.690
What ?

00:11:06.690 --> 00:11:09.490
Would you stop
putting on an act, then ?

00:11:09.490 --> 00:11:12.190
This and that are
two different things.

00:11:12.190 --> 00:11:13.450
No fair !

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:17.450
Thank you very much.

00:11:20.850 --> 00:11:21.850
Mylene.

00:11:22.250 --> 00:11:23.450
Bobby ?

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:25.580
Do you want to go out
for cake or something ?

00:11:26.550 --> 00:11:29.500
I was picked for the role of
Ichijo Hikaru all of a sudden, right ?

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:31.490
So, I'm a bit behind...

00:11:31.490 --> 00:11:32.250
But...

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:34.870
Basara just up and
decided to quit, right ?

00:11:35.900 --> 00:11:40.050
I'll bet he was planning to
quit right from the start.

00:11:40.050 --> 00:11:42.250
Anyway, the part was mine
for the taking, so I took it.

00:11:42.250 --> 00:11:43.960
Thank you so much.

00:11:43.960 --> 00:11:48.450
Now I'll have to do my best.
Don't you think so ?

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:51.600
It's still open, isn't it ?

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:54.310
I'm going out for cake with the
young lady, so bring the car around.

00:11:54.310 --> 00:11:54.960
Right away.

00:11:55.890 --> 00:11:57.460
What's going on, Mylene ?

00:11:57.460 --> 00:11:59.540
Bobby says he wants
to go out for cake.

00:11:59.540 --> 00:12:02.860
You know, to talk about business.
I won't keep her out too late.

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:06.050
On the way back, I'll bring
her back to the manager.

00:12:06.050 --> 00:12:07.530
Let's go, Minmei.

00:12:24.330 --> 00:12:28.780
You guys still haven't been on TV yet ?
This will be your first time ?

00:12:28.780 --> 00:12:29.740
Yes.

00:12:29.740 --> 00:12:32.910
In that case, I'll introduce
you to a lot of music producers.

00:12:32.910 --> 00:12:34.140
O...okay.

00:12:35.640 --> 00:12:38.080
Wait...was this the way ?

00:12:38.080 --> 00:12:40.310
Well, let's drive
around a bit.

00:12:40.310 --> 00:12:42.370
We can eat cake
in the car too.

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:45.360
Man, that Ray...

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:46.960
Always bugging
me for favors.

00:12:46.960 --> 00:12:49.350
I'm not Mylene's babysitter.

00:13:03.950 --> 00:13:06.260
Just where do you
expect to eat cake ?

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:07.800
I know a good place.

00:13:09.150 --> 00:13:11.830
I don't think it's
such a "good place."

00:13:11.830 --> 00:13:15.840
What's wrong ?
You shouldn't look so mad.

00:13:15.840 --> 00:13:19.550
Once you become famous, you'll never know
when a photographer is taking your picture...

00:13:19.550 --> 00:13:21.610
...so you can't look
mad like that.

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:24.100
Don't worry...
This is how I always look.

00:13:24.100 --> 00:13:26.460
But you do want
to become famous, right ?

00:13:26.460 --> 00:13:29.910
Where we're going, there are
a lot of entertainment people...

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:32.180
You'll be famous
in no time.

00:13:32.180 --> 00:13:34.840
Is that what it
means to be famous ?

00:13:36.450 --> 00:13:38.260
I don't wanna
get violent.

00:13:38.260 --> 00:13:40.580
What hotel does that
bastard usually use ?!

00:13:40.580 --> 00:13:42.450
Th...the Plito Hotel.

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:55.380
Okay, we're here.

00:13:55.380 --> 00:13:56.510
Shall we have some cake ?

00:13:56.510 --> 00:14:00.450
Thank you very much.
I had a lovely time.

00:14:01.080 --> 00:14:04.130
Wait a sec.
What are you talking about ?

00:14:04.130 --> 00:14:05.930
The fun has
yet to begin.

00:14:05.930 --> 00:14:08.750
I've had enough !
Let go of my arm !

00:14:08.750 --> 00:14:11.050
You aren't going
to be a child forever.

00:14:12.650 --> 00:14:14.750
I hate being called a child !

00:14:15.340 --> 00:14:17.340
I love stuff like this.

00:14:19.950 --> 00:14:21.440
What do you
think you're doing ?!

00:14:21.440 --> 00:14:22.500
Having some cake.

00:14:26.580 --> 00:14:28.350
Spiritia level 55.

00:14:28.950 --> 00:14:30.650
Who the hell are you ?

00:14:30.650 --> 00:14:32.170
A vampire !

00:14:36.150 --> 00:14:37.180
Bobby !

00:14:38.140 --> 00:14:39.850
Wait...wait a sec !

00:14:58.700 --> 00:14:59.800
Get in !

00:14:59.800 --> 00:15:00.550
Bobby is...

00:15:00.550 --> 00:15:01.630
What ?

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:03.950
Get out of my way !

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:14.060
Basara, hurry up !

00:15:14.060 --> 00:15:15.150
Shut up !

00:15:30.210 --> 00:15:33.790
Dammit !
Always causing me trouble...

00:15:33.790 --> 00:15:35.290
Basara...

00:15:35.290 --> 00:15:39.510
In the middle of the night, there are all
sorts of bloodsuckers running around.

00:15:39.510 --> 00:15:40.340
Be careful !

00:15:51.060 --> 00:15:54.950
What ?
Ichijo Hikaru quit ?

00:15:54.950 --> 00:15:57.500
It turns out Bobby
won't be able to do it.

00:15:57.500 --> 00:15:59.080
There's no one else.

00:15:59.080 --> 00:16:01.010
So I get stuck with it ?

00:16:01.010 --> 00:16:04.050
That's pretty much it.
It has to be you.

00:16:04.050 --> 00:16:06.270
You want me to be a
recruiter for the military ?!

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:07.670
Hear me out.

00:16:07.670 --> 00:16:12.950
It may be Captain Max's or Mayor Miria's
promo piece, but just think about it.

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:18.960
Macross 7 needs some good publicity,
and there aren't too many opportunities.

00:16:18.960 --> 00:16:20.800
The people are
afraid of the vampires.

00:16:20.800 --> 00:16:26.660
They're all over the place,
and causing all sorts of unrest.

00:16:26.660 --> 00:16:29.450
The military and the City Police
are doing all they can.

00:16:29.450 --> 00:16:36.490
But the situation is going from bad to worse.
The peace they had is crumbling and...

00:16:40.250 --> 00:16:44.140
In any case, you were
Ichijo Hikaru from the start.

00:16:44.140 --> 00:16:46.080
Suck it up and do it.

00:16:53.150 --> 00:16:56.310
Zoom, zoom. Zoom, zoom.

00:16:56.310 --> 00:17:00.900
My boyfriend is a pilot.

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:01.660
It flashes and makes a nose dive.

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:03.810
Why do I have to dress like this ?
It flashes and makes a nose dive.

00:17:03.810 --> 00:17:04.950
It flashes and makes a nose dive.

00:17:04.950 --> 00:17:05.070
It lets out a boom and zooms off.

00:17:05.070 --> 00:17:08.100
And putting all those goofy
ornaments on my Valkyrie...
It lets out a boom and zooms off.

00:17:08.100 --> 00:17:08.370
It lets out a boom and zooms off.

00:17:08.370 --> 00:17:14.150
In the contrail, with a long tail...

00:17:14.150 --> 00:17:20.700
...two big hearts overlap.

00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:22.680
A love sign in the pale blue sky.

00:17:22.680 --> 00:17:24.410
Okay, good pose.
A love sign in the pale blue sky.

00:17:24.410 --> 00:17:27.230
We'll transition to the
Zentraedi battle like this.
A love sign in the pale blue sky.

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:27.580
A love sign in the pale blue sky.

00:17:27.580 --> 00:17:27.620
I love you, you love me ?

00:17:27.620 --> 00:17:30.140
Scene 67, standby okay.
I love you, you love me ?

00:17:30.140 --> 00:17:30.720
I love you, you love me ?

00:17:30.720 --> 00:17:31.480
Start !
I love you, you love me ?

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:31.510
But instead of me...
Start !

00:17:31.510 --> 00:17:35.670
But instead of me...

00:17:35.670 --> 00:17:40.930
...he has a crush on his plane.

00:17:41.860 --> 00:17:45.130
Zoom, zoom. Zoom, zoom.

00:17:45.130 --> 00:17:50.990
My boyfriend is a pilot.

00:17:53.480 --> 00:17:54.740
What's that ?

00:17:54.740 --> 00:17:55.750
What is it ?

00:17:55.750 --> 00:17:58.700
Those aren't prop machines...
they're the enemy for real.

00:17:58.700 --> 00:17:59.960
No way !

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:03.420
Come and get it !

00:18:03.920 --> 00:18:05.500
I'll give you
plenty to listen to...

00:18:06.340 --> 00:18:07.430
My song !

00:18:09.820 --> 00:18:10.570
Let's go !

00:18:22.530 --> 00:18:23.450
Cut ! Cut !

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:25.670
What the hell does
